@startuml
title A / M-A.03a - Accept exact approval and dispatch one command\nAH-10 -> UC-04; UC-03 admission boundary
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4F8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #27465B
skinparam ArrowColor #27465B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF5D9
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Founder
boundary UI
control API
control "Domain Service" as Domain
control "Approval Guard" as Guard
database "Case / work / audit store" as Store
control "Operations Service" as Ops
participant "Simulated provider port" as Provider
participant "Scoped label artifact store" as Artifacts

Founder -> UI : Confirm current exact scope and reason
UI -> API : POST decisions(request, HTTP key)
API -> API : Authenticate + authorise addressed case; validate shape
break Access or shape invalid
  API --> UI : ErrorEnvelope; no domain work
end
API -> Domain : record_founder_decision(request, trusted context)
Domain -> Store : Read accepted request in principal/route/resource/key scope
alt Same key and canonical body already accepted
  Store --> Domain : Existing acceptance fact and current receipt readability
  alt Receipt body still retained and readable
    Domain --> API : Original receipt; no new work
    API --> UI : Receipt; GET current view separately
  else Receipt body permissibly deleted
    Domain --> API : 409 INVALID_STATE; retryable=false
    API --> UI : No new write, dispatch or automatic new key; GET current / history
  end
else Key used for another body
  Domain --> API : 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
else Fresh request
  Domain -> Store : Load current target and versions
  Domain -> Guard : G-REQUEST: actor, current target/state;\nRisk, preview/scope and expiry when APPROVE
  Guard --> Domain : Valid or reason for rejection
  break New intent invalid
    Domain --> API : Existing 409/403 ErrorEnvelope
  end
  alt APPROVE on eligible current proposal
    Domain -> Store : Atomic version check + decision + ApprovalRecord\n+ ordered work + audit + request receipt
    break Commit outcome not confirmed
      Domain --> API : Correlated error; same-key recovery, no dispatch
    end
    Domain --> API : DecisionReceipt
    API --> UI : 202 accepted, not execution complete
    ... asynchronous internal work, no public execute endpoint ...
    Domain ->> Ops : Committed-work signal (durable work is authoritative)
    Ops -> Domain : Load next persisted command and recorded history
    Domain -> Store : Read approval/work, command results and attempts
    Store --> Domain : Current snapshot + durable identities
    Domain --> Ops : Read-only execution context
    alt Saved success, confirmed-effect receipt or unresolved prior attempt
      ref over Domain, Artifacts : M-A.03b: reuse success / artifact-only recovery / query / yield
    else Unfinished command eligible for dispatch evaluation
      Ops -> Guard : Validate allowed case state, current passing Risk,\nexact scope, expiry and allowlist
      Guard --> Ops : Valid or blocked
      Ops -> Provider : Check configured provider permission (no effect)
      Provider --> Ops : Allowed or denied
      break Dispatch checks fail
        Ops -> Domain : Submit actual block; no provider effect
      end
      Ops -> Domain : Request atomic command claim with expected bindings
      Domain -> Store : Atomically claim command; register PENDING if needed;\nrecheck versions, dependency and retry safety;\nsave EXECUTING intent + audit before invocation
      Store --> Domain : Claim granted or conflict
      Domain --> Ops : Claimed command or rejection
      break Claim lost, save failed or authority changed
        note over Domain, Ops : No dispatch; losing worker does not change winner.
      end
      Ops -> Guard : Final pre-invocation validity check (G-DISPATCH);\nallow own claimed, not-yet-invoked reservation only
      Guard --> Ops : Allowed or blocked
      break Guard denied before invocation
        Ops -> Domain : Save BLOCKED and evidence; no effect invoked
      end
      Ops -> Provider : Invoke approved CommandSpec using stable provider key
      Provider --> Ops : Raw effect observation / definite no-effect failure / uncertainty
      alt Label effect confirmed
        Ops -> Domain : Submit original provider/command/parcel receipt
        Domain -> Store : Atomically save confirmed-effect fact + audit + artifact-only work;\nkeep EXECUTING without result
        break Receipt commit not confirmed
          note over Domain, Provider : No create retry. Recover prior durable intent / receipt\nand query only the original provider identity if still uncertain.
        end
        Ops -> Artifacts : G-ARTIFACT: validate and store original label only
        Artifacts --> Ops : Scoped evidence reference or storage failure
        Ops -> Domain : Submit artifact binding or actual storage error
        alt Full label reference validated
          Domain -> Store : Atomically save complete OperationResult + SUCCEEDED + audit
          Store --> Domain : Commit confirmed or unknown; recover saved receipt if unknown
        else Artifact incomplete
          note over Domain, Store : Retain confirmed receipt and artifact-only work; EXECUTING.\nNo incomplete success, UNKNOWN reclassification or new invoke.
        end
      else Complete return success / no-effect failure / uncertainty
        Ops -> Domain : record_operation_result(id, observation, work context)
        Domain -> Store : Validate complete result for SUCCEEDED, or save FAILED / UNKNOWN + audit
      end
      note over Domain, Store : A failed local save retains prior durable facts.\nCrash recovery checks known-effect receipts before uncertain-effect lookup.
    end
  else REQUEST_REVISION on current proposal
    Domain -> Store : Atomically recheck target; save revision + audit\n+ request key/body/receipt; invalidate continuing authority
    break Commit outcome not confirmed
      Domain --> API : Correlated error; same-key recovery
    end
    Domain --> API : DecisionReceipt
    API --> UI : 202; new proposal and independent review required
  else Permitted REJECT / MANUAL_HANDLING
    Domain -> Store : Atomically recheck target; save outcome + audit\n+ notification-only work + request key/body/receipt
    break Commit outcome not confirmed
      Domain --> API : Correlated error; same-key recovery; no notification dispatch
    end
    Domain --> API : DecisionReceipt
    API --> UI : 202; saved outcome awaits notification
    note over Domain, Store : No-proposal failure/block permits only MANUAL_HANDLING.\nNo ApprovalRecord or operational command is created.
  end
end
legend bottom
  MA-0.3 candidate; messages are conceptual calls except the documented HTTP operation.
  Guard checks before invocation must be enforced by the runtime concurrency design (MA-Q03).
endlegend
@enduml
